\f0\b \cb3 1 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0You hear two students talking about their first geography class of the year.\cb1 \
\cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 How do they both feel?\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 A
