\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 B 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0concerned that it was more difficult than they\'92d expected\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 C 
