\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 C 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0monitor the range of wild birds that visit his garden\cb1 \
\

\f0\b \cb3 3 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0You hear a girl telling a friend about a spelling competition she won.\cb1 \
\cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 What does she say about it?\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 A
