\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 B 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0She found that her good visual memory helped her the most.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 C 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0She wasn\'92t concerned by the level of level of the other competitors.\cb1 \
\

\f0\b \cb3 4 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0You hear a technology teacher telling her students about the model cars they are going to make.\cb1 \
\cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 What does she warn them about?\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 A
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0 being inaccurate as they develop their model\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 B 
