\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 C 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0finding they need tools that the school doesn\'92t currently have\cb1 \
\

\f0\b \cb3 5 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0You hear a boy talking to his sister about a sweatshirt he bought recently.\cb1 \
\cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 Why is he unhappy with it?\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 A
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0 He\'92s worried it may already have gone out of fashion.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 B 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0He feels it\'92s poor quality for the price he paid.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 C 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0He thinks the colour doesn\'92t suit him at all.\cb1 \
\

\f0\b \cb3 6 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0You hear a school football coach talking to his team about avoiding injuries.\cb1 \
\cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 What does he propose for this season?\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 A
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0 checking players drink enough fluids before training and matches\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 B 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0improving the exercises at the start of their training sessions.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 C 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0making a specific type of training a regular event\cb1 \
\

\f0\b \cb3 7 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0You hear a girl talking to her friend about a building she\'92s just visited.\cb1 \
\cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 Why is she telling her about it?\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 A
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0 to recommend it as somewhere worth visiting\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 B 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0to confirm that his opinion about it was correct\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 C 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0to explain why she decided to go there\cb1 \
\

\f0\b \cb3 8 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0You hear a boy leaving a phone message for a friend about a family camping holiday.\cb1 \
\cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 What does he say about the holiday?\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 A
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0 They feel inspired to repeat the experience.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 B 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0They managed to make the best of a bad situation.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 C 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0They were disappointed after all their preparation.\cb1 \
