\f0\b \cb3 24 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0Why did John decide to enter the race?\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 A
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0 He was encouraged by his father to take part.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 B 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0He wanted to prove his friends wrong.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 C 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0He was inspired by a celebrity\'92s achievements.\cb1 \
\

\f0\b \cb3 25 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0One feature of John\'92s training before the event was to\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 A
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0 get some rest between training sessions.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 B 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0leave himself enough time to build up his fitness.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 C 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0set targets that he felt were realistic.\cb1 \
\

\f0\b \cb3 26 
\f1\b0 \'a0\'a0John says that once he started training, he had difficulties\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 \'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0\'a0 A
